  "policy": "Distilled from the owner-supplied launch-day chart, cross-checked cell-by-cell against the prior Norumu harvest AND the repo's own EXPECTED_RAID_LEVELS validator constant. Where the two community sources agree the cell counts as confirmed; where the launch chart corrects the pre-launch sheet (crafted quality-5 ilvls 292/308/321 -> 305/318/331) the newer dated source wins and the correction is recorded here rather than in conflicts[]. The delve rows were NOT re-cut from the chart (its delve panel is too dense to transcribe with honest confidence) and keep their Norumu values and provisional markers. PvP rows are chart-only: they are PvP item levels (the level gear scales to IN PvP instances), a different quantity from world ilvl, and are labeled as such.",
  "authorCaveats": [
    "Mythic bosses 7-8 drop and Vault at 344 — a higher ilvl than the Myth track cap (334) — and cannot be upgraded",
    "Great Vault raid rewards: LFR/N/H are always 1/6 on the next track up; Mythic bosses 1-6 are always 6/6 Myth",
    "Bonus rolls (Nebulous Voidcores) cost 1 token (raids previously 2) and grant gear at the Great Vault ilvl for that activity",
    "Ascendant Venomstones (gear upgrades) return later in Season 2 — the stored venomstone rows are pre-launch estimates",
    "Honor gear is not upgradeable; catalyzed gear now inherits secondary stats and cantrip effects from the original item"
